    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Devellin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "She's the type of person who'll do anything to get what she wants. I'm worried that she might give away something far more valuable than a diamond in exchange...",
      "translation" : "她是那种为了得到想要的东西什么都做得出来的人。我担心她会拿比钻石贵重得多的东西去交换..."
